## Stop only when

- Active iteration pass criteria are fully satisfied and the next iteration is not yet scheduled in the same session goal, OR
- A safety rule would be violated, OR
- External credentials/network are truly unavailable after retries — then record the blocker in `artifacts/` and continue with the next unblocked task
